{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face an unrelenting onslaught of savage creatures in this adrenaline-fueled 2D top-down arcade-shooter where every second is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to master a vast and devastating arsenal of weapons, from blistering-fast machine guns to screen-clearing explosives, as you carve a path of destruction across the 8 intricately detailed maps the world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle; it's a journey of growth. You'll level up your survivor through a deep and unique class and perk system, fine-tuning your abilities to become the ultimate monster-slaying force and constantly shattering your previous high scores as your power grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the nightmare alone; endure the peril as a solitary hero, or form a squad with up to 3 other friends and watch each other's backs in a glorious symphony of cooperative chaos</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886690?t=1760062267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886690/a2c76f9365be8e9f81712558497e47a37782a580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760062267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886690/30d3557bff10e43f4a2e5b2dc32b8e1a0f096bec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760062267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886690/30d3557bff10e43f4a2e5b2dc32b8e1a0f096bec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760062267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has zombies that have blood on them and bleed when hitted."},"demos":[{"appid":40066